<title>AUSTRALIA: Oil Search 6-mo net profit A$9.06 mln.</title>
<headline>Oil Search 6-mo net profit A$9.06 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 23.66  vs 21.38</p>
<p>    Net profit			  9.06  vs  13.53</p>
<p>    Sales				39.58  vs  34.89</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		 nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Oil Search Ltd, a Papua New Guinea-based oil explorer and producer listed on the Australian Stock Exchange, reports its financial performance in Papua New Guinea kina and converts the results to Australian dollars.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
